OL,3,ATrump says Iran war is 'effectively
OL,4,Aover' militarily with further strikes
OL,5,Aunlikely
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says the Iran war
OL,8,F"militarily is effectively over"
OL,9,Fdeclaring that there is "positive
OL,10,Fmomentum" behind negotiations to end
OL,11,Fthe Middle East conflict.
OL,13,F"We're just keeping it the status quo,"
OL,14,Fthe US president said on Monday. "And
OL,15,Fwe're doing that really at the behest
OL,16,Fof countries that are their
OL,17,Fneighbours."
